{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/f610ze98","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":298,"top":213,"width":510,"height":49},"text":"Q1整理宏观与风格指标，结合各类因子，为现有时序模型补充市场状态输入。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ulsj698n","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":298,"top":267,"width":510,"height":49},"text":"Q2比较有无风格感知的模型，检查不同市场阶段的因子权重与样本外表现。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tkjix4ri","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":273,"top":321,"width":540,"height":29},"text":"多任务学习：共享GRU，预测不同期限","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sjah4zqx","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":298,"top":351,"width":510,"height":49},"text":"设置1、3、5日收益预测头，先以等权损失训练，与单一5日标签模型对比。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7ih0vu9c","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":298,"top":405,"width":510,"height":49},"text":"5日RankIC与成本后收益改善后，再研究自适应标签权重，另留独立样本检验。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6h8z2psr","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":273,"top":459,"width":540,"height":29},"text":"模型验证：固定基线，保留实验依据","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
